> >    numbers, because every promised date is exactly Lead_Time_Days after the order date. The rule is corrected; the
> >    expected figures are unchanged.
> > 2. Check 4: days of cover was printed as 32.47. The candidate value is 32.4650 (32.464996…), which rounds to **32.46**.
