> Lead time (corrected in v2). The engine rule is L = Materials.Lead_Time_Days for RM001 (**35**) + the average lateness of
> RM001's supplier **SUP001**: the mean of (Received_Date − Promised_Date) over all SUP001 purchase-order lines (not only
> RM001's) received and ordered on or before the snapshot date, counted only if positive. That gives 20 lines.
> σL is the population s.d. of (Received_Date − Order_Date) over the same 20 lines. Both are listed in
> `check2-supplier-lead-times-v2.txt`.
